{
  "_readme": [
    "Markdown to HTML for export, and the page a note is printed from.",
    "",
    "The inline rules are six regex replacements run one after another over",
    "the whole string, and the order is load-bearing: **bold** becomes a tag",
    "before the single-star rule ever sees it. The cases here are the ones",
    "where that matters, plus the ones where a pattern refuses to match.",
    "",
    "One of those patterns contains \\S, which without the u flag is ASCII -",
    "so the link target rules are hand-written on the Rust side rather than",
    "handed to a regex crate that would read it as Unicode.",
    "",
    "Everything is escaped before any markup is added, so a note containing",
    "HTML exports as the text it is. The <script> case is there to say so.",
    "",
    "Run: pnpm run test (TypeScript) and cargo test (Rust). Both read this."
  ],
  "escapeHtml": [
    {
      "text": "",
      "escaped": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "plain",
      "escaped": "plain"
    },
    {
      "text": "a & b",
      "escaped": "a &amp; b"
    },
    {
      "text": "<b>",
      "escaped": "&lt;b&gt;"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"quoted\"",
      "escaped": "&quot;quoted&quot;"
    },
    {
      "text": "&amp;",
      "escaped": "&amp;amp;"
    },
    {
      "text": "&<>\"",
      "escaped": "&amp;&lt;&gt;&quot;"
    },
    {
      "text": "café 😀",
      "escaped": "café 😀"
    }
  ],
  "markdownToHtml": [
    {
      "body": "",
      "html": ""
    },
    {
      "body": "Just a sentence.\n",
      "html": "<p>Just a sentence.</p>"
    },
    {
      "body": "A paragraph\nwrapped over\nthree lines.\n",
      "html": "<p>A paragraph wrapped over three lines.</p>"
    },
    {
      "body": "# Heading one\n## Two\n### Three\n###### Six\n####### Seven\n#NoSpace\n",
      "html": "<h1>Heading one</h1>\n<h2>Two</h2>\n<h3>Three</h3>\n<h6>Six</h6>\n<p>####### Seven #NoSpace</p>"
    },
    {
      "body": "- one\n- two\n* three\n+ four\n  - indented\n",
      "html": "<ul><li>one</li><li>two</li><li>three</li><li>four</li><li>indented</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "body": "Before\n\n- a list\n\nAfter\n",
      "html": "<p>Before</p>\n<ul><li>a list</li></ul>\n<p>After</p>"
    },
    {
      "body": "---\n***\n___\n  ---  \n----\n",
      "html": "<hr>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<p>----</p>"
    },
    {
      "body": "```\ncode *not* emphasised\n```\n",
      "html": "<pre><code>code *not* emphasised</code></pre>"
    },
    {
      "body": "~~~\nalso code\n~~~\n",
      "html": "<pre><code>also code</code></pre>"
    },
    {
      "body": "```js\nconst x = 1\n```\n",
      "html": "<pre><code>const x = 1</code></pre>"
    },
    {
      "body": "```\nunclosed fence\n",
      "html": "<pre><code>unclosed fence\n</code></pre>"
    },
    {
      "body": "`inline code` and `more`\n",
      "html": "<p><code>inline code</code> and <code>more</code></p>"
    },
    {
      "body": "**bold** and *em* and ~~struck~~\n",
      "html": "<p><strong>bold</strong> and <em>em</em> and <del>struck</del></p>"
    },
    {
      "body": "***both*** and **a *nested* thing**\n",
      "html": "<p><em><strong>both</strong></em> and **a <em>nested</em> thing**</p>"
    },
    {
      "body": "*a* *b* *c*\n",
      "html": "<p><em>a</em> <em>b</em> <em>c</em></p>"
    },
    {
      "body": "a*b*c\n",
      "html": "<p>a<em>b</em>c</p>"
    },
    {
      "body": "* not a list because no space\n",
      "html": "<ul><li>not a list because no space</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "body": "an unmatched * star\n",
      "html": "<p>an unmatched * star</p>"
    },
    {
      "body": "an unmatched ` tick\n",
      "html": "<p>an unmatched ` tick</p>"
    },
    {
      "body": "[link](https://example.com) and ![img](a.png)\n",
      "html": "<p><a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a> and <img alt=\"img\" src=\"a.png\"></p>"
    },
    {
      "body": "![](empty-alt.png)\n",
      "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"empty-alt.png\"></p>"
    },
    {
      "body": "[](empty-label.png)\n",
      "html": "<p>[](empty-label.png)</p>"
    },
    {
      "body": "[spaced](has space.png)\n",
      "html": "<p>[spaced](has space.png)</p>"
    },
    {
      "body": "[nested [brackets]](x.png)\n",
      "html": "<p>[nested [brackets]](x.png)</p>"
    },
    {
      "body": "[a](b) [c](d)\n",
      "html": "<p><a href=\"b\">a</a> <a href=\"d\">c</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "body": "<script>alert(1)</script>\n",
      "html": "<p>&lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt;</p>"
    },
    {
      "body": "AT&T said \"hello\" <b>bold</b>\n",
      "html": "<p>AT&amp;T said &quot;hello&quot; &lt;b&gt;bold&lt;/b&gt;</p>"
    },
    {
      "body": "a & b < c > d\n",
      "html": "<p>a &amp; b &lt; c &gt; d</p>"
    },
    {
      "body": "**bold with <tag> inside**\n",
      "html": "<p><strong>bold with &lt;tag&gt; inside</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "body": "`code with <tag>`\n",
      "html": "<p><code>code with &lt;tag&gt;</code></p>"
    },
    {
      "body": "# Heading with **bold** and `code`\n",
      "html": "<h1>Heading with <strong>bold</strong> and <code>code</code></h1>"
    },
    {
      "body": "- item with [a link](x) and *em*\n",
      "html": "<ul><li>item with <a href=\"x\">a link</a> and <em>em</em></li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "body": "Þingvellir — naïve café 😀\n",
      "html": "<p>Þingvellir — naïve café 😀</p>"
    },
    {
      "body": "  \n\t\n",
      "html": ""
    },
    {
      "body": "line one\n\n\n\nline two\n",
      "html": "<p>line one</p>\n<p>line two</p>"
    }
  ],
